1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,730
In this town,

2
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:01,930
you can only
say names

3
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:03,000
one hundred
times.

4
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,260
Every time you do,

5
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:05,400
your number
goes down.

6
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:06,930
And when it
reaches zero,

7
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,330
everyone
forgets you.

8
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:09,600
Eli still had

9
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,530
all one hundred.

10
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:11,860
Not because
he was brave,

11
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,000
not because
he was smart.

12
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:14,530
He was just
too shy

13
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,730
to call anyone
by name.

14
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:16,800
Every night,

15
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:17,930
pale figures stood

16
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:18,930
outside his
window.

17
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,860
The town called
them ghosts.

18
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:21,730
But one night,

19
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:22,800
one of them
held up

20
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,730
a faded name tag.

21
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,330
Eli leaned closer.

22
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:26,330
Mara,

23
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:27,200
he whispered.

24
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,330
His number
dropped

25
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,130
to ninety-nine,

26
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:30,930
and the ghost
turned human.

27
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:32,400
That's when he
understood.

28
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:33,530
They weren't
dead.

29
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:34,660
They were
forgotten.

30
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,400
So Eli opened
the door,

31
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:37,400
and started saying

32
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,530
every name
he could.

33
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:39,930
One after another.

34
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:40,860
Fifty-two.

35
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:41,730
Eighteen.

36
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:42,330
Three.

37
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,000
One.

38
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,130
By sunrise,

39
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,530
the forgotten
were home again.

40
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:46,730
Mothers cried.

41
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,200
Friends ran
to each other.

42
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:49,460
Families were
whole.

43
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,000
And Eli's number

44
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:51,330
hit zero.

45
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:52,260
After that,

46
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:53,400
no one
remembered

47
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,460
the boy who
saved them.
